
# --- Copilot CLI version pin (added by setup-devcontainer) ---
# Copilot CLI version: "latest" always installs the newest release via
# npm, matching the vendor's own default; pin an exact version (e.g.
# 1.0.82) to lock it instead. Like Codex, Copilot has no background
# auto-updater to fight — it only updates via the explicit `copilot update`
# command — so a pin here holds on its own; COPILOT_AUTO_UPDATE=false stays
# set regardless, as defensive insurance against Copilot's known
# self-update instability (see README's "CLI installer notes"). To go back
# to always-latest, set this to "latest" (or delete the line), then rebuild.
COPILOT_VERSION={{COPILOT_VERSION}}
